WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.862
Unit 3 is the plan and the write path.

2
00:00:02.862 --> 00:00:06.487
Each conversion gets actions,
and only three ever write.

3
00:00:06.487 --> 00:00:09.439
Create identity, for a
user-assigned identity

4
00:00:09.439 --> 00:00:11.925
the file asks for that doesn't exist yet.

5
00:00:11.925 --> 00:00:14.875
Create credential, for
a federated credential

6
00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:17.750
that passes every check
and its exchange test.

7
00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.512
And disable legacy, after
a clean thirty-day parallel

8
00:00:21.512 --> 00:00:25.188
run and the owner's approval,
with Disable A D Account.

9
00:00:25.188 --> 00:00:28.409
Everything else is a status,
from awaiting cutover,

10
00:00:28.409 --> 00:00:32.626
to parallel running, to awaiting
the owner's approval, to converted.

11
00:00:32.626 --> 00:00:36.475
The thresholds for a clean run
are the program's design guidance.

12
00:00:36.475 --> 00:00:38.263
The write path is separate.

13
00:00:38.263 --> 00:00:42.109
It runs only the plan whose hash
was approved, one write at a time,

14
00:00:42.109 --> 00:00:46.990
the identity before its credential,
because Microsoft Learn's trust page warns

15
00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:51.501
that parallel creates under one identity
fail, and it never sends a delete.

16
00:00:51.501 --> 00:00:54.119
And it runs as a person
with Cloud Application

17
00:00:54.119 --> 00:00:57.070
Administrator and Managed
Identity Contributor.
